08031ED8 text-cursor-return

TextState_AdvanceCursor updates the state through r2 and preserves the input r0.

The explicit form changed the ROM bytes. The guarded form passed the unit ROM check.

--- a/src/fn/sub_08031ED8.c
+++ b/src/fn/sub_08031ED8.c
@@ -19,3 +19,6 @@
     else
         p->x += 2;
+#ifdef UBFIX
+    return (int)p; // preserve the inherited GBA return value
+#endif
 }
